  "content": "<h1>選擇性邊界</h1><p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fselectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=000000&amp;color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/SelectiveBounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"透過 Crowdin 翻譯\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=crowdin&amp;color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p><p>\n在不相關時隱藏醜陋的方塊選取輪廓，特別是在樹葉和非固體方塊上。\n<br>\n當裝備錯誤的工具，或工具根本無法挖掘時，輪廓會智慧地隱藏。\n蹲下或建造/破壞方塊時，會暫時重新顯示輪廓。\n行為可在 <code>configs/selectivebounds.json</code> 中完全設定。\n</p><p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/screenshots/screen.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p><h1>沉浸收藏</h1><p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式盔甲&amp;description=許多獨特且忠於原版的盔甲套裝。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式盔甲\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式飛行器&amp;description=一系列用於旅行、運輸和探索的鄉村風飛行器！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式飛行器\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式旋律&amp;description=用各種樂器演奏自訂旋律，並吵鬧你的朋友們！&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式旋律\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式繪畫&amp;description=拖放、像素化並懸掛美麗的藝術作品。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式繪畫\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式最佳化&amp;description=一個輕量級的實體刻排程器，可將TPS提升一倍。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式最佳化\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=選擇性邊界&amp;description=在不相關時隱藏醜陋的方塊選取輪廓。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"選擇性邊界\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=多機之人&amp;description=一組為沉浸式飛行器設計的額外飛行器，並考慮了Create模組的支援。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"多機之人\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式機械&amp;description=一系列用於運輸、挖掘和自動化的鄉村風機械。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式機械\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式家具&amp;description=在遊戲中自訂並製作精美家具，或從龐大的線上圖庫中挑選。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式家具\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=沉浸式傳送門&amp;description=散落在主世界各處，神秘且被遺忘許久的傳送門。&amp;icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&amp;width=275&amp;height=100&amp;background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸式傳送門\">\n</a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=341edc128ff31c52a3315deca767a615\" alt=\"頁面哈希值，用於簡化頁面部署。\"></p>",
